  "exact_top_note": "> **Intonation: current source context.** App key `Intonation` labels the guided 12th-fret instrument-setup check (`IntonationView`: harmonic/fretted comparison and saddle advice). `Intonation over a drone` is separate pitch-accuracy practice; lesson uses follow their own context. This rule supersedes copied drone-only definitions and “never saddle/octave adjustment” claims below.",
